kbook:Egg Yolk|egg yolks]] OR 3 [[Cookbook:Ounce|oz]] egg substitute with lecithin\n*1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|Tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Lemon Juice|lemon juice]]\n*½ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n*2 [[Cookbook:Cup|cups]] [[Cookbook:Olive Oil|olive oil]]\n*¼ cup tomato [[Cookbook:Ketchup|ketchup]]\n*2 Tbsp sweet pickle relish or chutney\n*1 Tbsp prepared [[Cookbook:Horseradish|horseradish]]\n*1 tsp [[Cookbook:Worcestershire Sauce|Worcestershire sauce]]\n*1 tsp store-bought [[Cookbook:Hot Sauce|hot sauce]]\n*2 Tbsp chopped [[Cookbook:Green Onion|scallions]]\n*½ tsp [[Cookbook:Cayenne Pepper|cayenne pepper]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n# Combine the eggs, lemon juice and salt in a [[Cookbook:Blender|blender]]. [[Cookbook:Puréeing|Blend]] briefly.\n# While motor is running, add oil in a slow, steady stream until the mixture has emulsified into a [[Cookbook:Mayonnaise|mayonnaise]]. \n# Transfer to a bowl and add the remaining ingredients. \n# Season with salt and pepper to taste. \n\n\n[[Category:Recipes for dip]]\n[[Category:Recipes for sauces and condiments]]\n[[Category:United States recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for mayonnaise]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cayenne]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ketchup]]\n[[Category:Recipes using horseradish]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using green onion]]\n[[Category:Recipes using hot sauce]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Hot and Spicy Dip","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2 eggs OR 4 soft-boiled egg yolks OR 3 oz egg substitute with lecithin","sourceText":"2 eggs OR 4 soft-boiled egg yolks OR 3 oz egg substitute with lecithin","amountText":"2 eggs OR 4 soft-boiled egg yolks OR 3 oz egg substitute with lecithin","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 Tbsp lemon juice","sourceText":"1 Tbsp lemon juice","amountText":"1 Tbsp lemon juice","amount":null,"unit":null,